{
    "background_story": "Dearie was a sturdy bullock with a gentle disposition, known for his impressive strength and unwavering reliability. For years, he plodded along the dusty trails of rural Australia, hauling heavy loads of timber and supplies to remote outposts. His broad shoulders and powerful muscles made him a valuable asset to the local farmers, who relied on him to get the job done. Despite the scorching sun and rugged terrain, Dearie never faltered, his bullocky spirit driving him to push through even the toughest conditions. At the end of each long day, he'd return to the farm, his eyes calm and content, ready to rest and do it all again come dawn. Dearie's dedication and strength earned him a special place in the hearts of the community, who affectionately called him 'the backbone of the farm'.",
